sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Recycler as Co so thu gom (Role: Recycler)
    participant UI as React Web App (SCR-RCY-01)
    participant Ctrl as RecyclerController
    participant Svc as RecyclerManagementService
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (ApplicationDbContext)

    Note over Recycler,UI: Luong tra cuu Bang gia (kiem tra gia cu > 30 ngay JOB-04) & Luu hang loat (Save price sheet)

    %% Buoc 1: Xem bang gia hien tai va kiem tra co IsOutdated (> 30 ngay)
    Recycler->>+UI: 1. Mo bang gia niem yet & nhap tu khoa loc (keyword, isActive)
    UI->>+Ctrl: 2. GET /api/v1/recycler/prices?keyword=plastic&isActive=true
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 3. GetPricesAsync(recyclerId, keyword, isActive, ct)
    Svc->>+DB: 4. SELECT * FROM recycler_price_list JOIN waste_categories WHERE recycler_id = @recyclerId
    DB-->>-Svc: 5. Return List<RecyclerPrice>
    Note over Svc: Tinh toan co canh bao gia cu (JOB-04):<br/>IsOutdated = (DateTime.UtcNow - UpdatedAt).TotalDays > 30
    Svc-->>-Ctrl: 6. Return IReadOnlyList<RecyclerPriceDto>
    Ctrl-->>-UI: 7. 200 OK: ApiResponse<IReadOnlyList<RecyclerPriceDto>>
    UI-->>-Recycler: 8. Hien thi bang gia (Gach nhan canh bao neu IsOutdated == true)

    %% Buoc 2: Luu hang loat toan bo bang gia (PUT /api/v1/recycler/prices)
    Recycler->>+UI: 9. Dieu chinh gia nhieu loai phe lieu cung luc & Bam nut 'Save price sheet'
    UI->>+Ctrl: 10. PUT /api/v1/recycler/prices (BulkSavePricesRequest { Items })
    Ctrl->>+Svc: 11. BulkSavePricesAsync(recyclerId, request, ct)
    Svc->>+DB: 12. SELECT profile, waste_categories & existing recycler_price_list rows
    DB-->>-Svc: 13. Return profile, categories dict & existing rows

    alt Danh sach chua WasteCategoryId trung lap hoac chon 'trash' hoac Gia khong nguyen duong (BR-MTH-03)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 14a. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-MTH-03", "MSG-GEN-01")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 15a. 400 Bad Request: Danh sach loai phe lieu hoac don gia khong hop le
        UI-->>Recycler: 16a. Hien thi thong bao loi tren man hinh
    else Co so dang Online nhung tat ca cac dong sau khi luu deu Inactive (BR-MTH-03 / EF-03)
        Svc-->>Ctrl: 14b. Throw BusinessRuleException ("BR-MTH-03", "MSG-MTH-06")
        Ctrl-->>UI: 15b. 400 Bad Request: Vui long giu it nhat 1 loai phe lieu nhan mua khi dang hoat dong
        UI-->>Recycler: 16b. Yeu cau bat it nhat 1 loai phe lieu
    else Du lieu hop le (Upsert & Lam moi moc UpdatedAt cho JOB-04)
        Note over Svc: 1. Neu chua co dong gia va IsActive == true -> INSERT<br/>2. Neu da co -> UPDATE PricePerKg, MinQuantityKg, Status<br/>3. Gan UpdatedAt = DateTime.UtcNow (Xoa co IsOutdated > 30 ngay)
        Svc->>+DB: 14c. INSERT / UPDATE recycler_price_list (SaveChangesAsync)
        DB-->>-Svc: 15c. Commit Transaction
        Svc-->>-Ctrl: 16c. Return IReadOnlyList<RecyclerPriceDto> (IsOutdated = false)
        Ctrl-->>-UI: 17c. 200 OK: ApiResponse<IReadOnlyList<RecyclerPriceDto>> ("Da luu va cong bo bang gia.")
        UI-->>-Recycler: 18c. Thong bao cong bo bang gia moi thanh cong
    end

